{title: Awargi}
{artist: Ghulam Ali}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm],        ye dil ye pagal dil mera
[Am] [F],        kyon bujh gaya aawargi
[Gm],        is dasht mein ik shahar tha
[F] [Dm],        vo kya hua aawargi
[Dm],        kal shab mujhe be-shakl ki
[Dm] [F] [C] [Dm],        aawaaz ne chaunka diya
[Dm],        main ne kaha tu kaun hai
[F] [Dm],        usne kahaa aawargi
[Dm],        yeh dard ki tanhhaiyan
[Dm] [F] [C] [Dm],        yeh dasht ka veran safar
[Dm],        hum log to uqtaa gaye
[F] [Dm],        apni suna aawargi
[Dm],        logon bhala us shehar me
[Dm] [F] [C] [Dm],        kaise jeyain hum jahan
[Dm],        ho jurm tanha sochna
[F] [Dm],        lekin saza awargi
[Dm],        ik ajnabi jhonke ne jab
[Dm] [F] [C] [Dm],        pucha mere gam ka sabab
[Dm],        sahara ki bheegi rait par
[F] [Dm],        main ne likha aawargi
[Dm],        kal ratt tanha chand ko
[Dm] [F] [C] [Dm],        dekha tha main ne khawab main
[Dm],        mohsin mujhay rass aye gi
[F] [Dm],        shayad sada aawargi
